{"id":"vod_sn_38939","vodId":"38939","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"电脑线圈","name_cn":"电脑线圈","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1f05797832b03b9f696a1ada409d03cc.jpg"},"summary":"故事背景是在202X年，那个时候的科技已经到达了一个新高度，普通的笔记本电脑已经满足不了时代的需求。在儿童中间流行的是号称“电脑眼镜”的新科技产品。通过镜片可以获得电脑、电话般的功能，轻便的物体也在大人中间开始流行。六年级的小此木优子（折笠富美子 配音）因为父亲工作的调动，进入到大黑市的小学就读。和她一起来的还有她的妹妹晶子（矢岛晶子 配音）和宠物狗佐助。　　在学校里，她先后认识了文惠（小岛幸子 配音）、和她名字同音的勇子（桑岛法子 配音）、原贤（朴璐美 配音）等人，后来优子又加入到了学校的电脑侦探局。看似平常的电脑眼镜背后却暗藏玄机，侦探局的一行人开始了和科技的大作战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:05:57","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wRuuTKMUyN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0mpGz0pmdZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d3SfFnZCwK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/n1wv0PYp7N1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v30jHHhXqT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JDWPT31ZNG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/My1Q2RwQLN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UQpMDm4Rd81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/y7bg27Aphv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mWCd1A5SAV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WJQDpm3cEm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DSP9r8kBVv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZtbKqhT09v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4yjkNavaDq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集